<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49994/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a></td>
<td>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36855/lady-deathwhisper">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Deathwhisper</span></a> - <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> 25</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50449/stiffened-corpse-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_119.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stiffened Corpse Shoulderpads</span></a></td>
<td>Trash drop in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>7</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50472/nightmare-ender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Ender</span></a></td>
<td>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36789/valithria-dreamwalker">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Valithria Dreamwalker</span></a> - <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> 25</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>8</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a></td>
<td>
<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=197/tailoring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>
<br/>Recipe drops from all bosses in Ulduar</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<br/>
<br/>There are plenty of fantastic Bind on Equip items that you can pick up if you just cannot fit all your gold into your pockets anymore. None of these items are going to be our Best in Slot throughout Icecrown Citadel though, and in most cases trail fairly far behind. <br/>
<br/>Some of them can be worth picking up even knowing you will replace them, especially if you know your guild situation and can predict that you might not a chase item anytime soon.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Shadow Priest DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41285/chaotic-skyflare-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaotic Skyflare Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40152/potent-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potent Ametrine</span></a></div></li></ul>We want the maximum Spell Power available from each gem slot. Typically this means shoving <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a> into everything we can. If one blue gem can activate a socket bonus that gives 5 or more Spell Power, it is generally going to be worth using. Activating a socket bonus of 7 or more Spell Power with a Yellow gem can also be worth doing, but this is not always the case, depending on your current gear.<br/>
<br/>To activate our Meta gem, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41285/chaotic-skyflare-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaotic Skyflare Diamond</span></a>, we will need two blue gems, so make sure you get the most out of your socket bonuses with these. Meta gems are a massive DPS increase and should never be overlooked!<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Shadow Priest DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head -          <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Burning Mysteries</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Shoulder -          <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44135/greater-inscription-of-the-storm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_lightningoverload.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of the Storm</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Back -              <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55642/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Chest -             <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60692/enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Wrist -             <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60767/enchant-bracers-superior-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Superior Spellpower</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hands -             <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44592/enchant-gloves-exceptional-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Exceptional Spellpower</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Waist -             <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Belt Buckle</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Legs -              <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41602/brilliant-spellthread">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Spellthread</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Feet -              <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60623/enchant-boots-icewalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Icewalker</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">One-Hand Weapon -  <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59625/enchant-weapon-black-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Black Magic</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60714/enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spellpower</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Two-Handed Weapon - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62948/enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Staff - Greater Spellpower</span></a></div></li></ul>There isn't a ton of wiggle room with our enchants, but professions do add a lot of various options, even if they are mostly straight-forward. <br/>
<br/>Boots are the most variable, having 3 potential options. Engineers will always want <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>, there is simply too much benefit to pass up. Outside of that, players will have to choose between <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60623/enchant-boots-icewalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Icewalker</span></a>. Your choice here falls very simply into if you want the 8% movement speed to keep up with your raid and avoid mechanics slightly faster, or if you want more damage stats. <br/>
<br/>Another choice is between weapon enchants. Players using a two-handed weapon will always want to use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62948/enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Staff - Greater Spellpower</span></a>. Players using a one-handed weapon will have to choose between a Haste proc from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59625/enchant-weapon-black-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Black Magic</span></a> or flat Spell Power from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60714/enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spellpower</span></a>. The difference between this two is rarely massive, but depending on your other stats, procs, and fight duration, one will usually be a clear winner. To determine this, you will need to sim your gear, this is not something you can just guess at.</div>